 "Cada clic lleva el coche 3D a la siguiente parada de la costa (Trayectoria) y aparece lo que hicimos allí. El borde de cada frase indica el auxiliar: terracota essere, azul avere. Las palabras y frases en italiano van en cursiva (o en su recuadro): no se traducen.": "Each click takes the 3D car to the next stop on the coast (Motion path) and shows what we did there. The border of each sentence shows the auxiliary: terracotta essere, blue avere. Italian words and phrases are in italics (or in their box): they are not translated.",
