 "get on with = llevarse bien con": "get on with = have a good relationship with",
 "Concurso con puntos. «Look after» = cuidar de; «look for» = buscar; «look up» = buscar en un diccionario; «look out» = ¡cuidado! Los verbos y frases en inglés van en cursiva o en su propio bloque: no se traducen.": "Points quiz. «Look after» = take care of; «look for» = try to find; «look up» = search in a dictionary; «look out» = be careful! English verbs and phrases are in italics or in their own block: they are not translated.",
 "My grandma ___ me when my parents are at work.": "My grandma ___ me when my parents are at work.",
