 "<b><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Currently I live in Madrid.</i></b>": "<b><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Currently I live in Madrid.</i></b>",
 "<i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">My sister is very sensible: she cries at films.</i>": "<i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">My sister is very sensible: she cries at films.</i>",
 "<b><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">My sister is very sensitive: she cries at films.</i></b>": "<b><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">My sister is very sensitive: she cries at films.</i></b>",
 "Votación de respuesta múltiple desde el móvil. Son falsos amigos embarrassed, carpet y library; hospital, animal y chocolate son amigos de verdad. Las opciones están en inglés y no se traducen.": "Multiple-answer poll on phones. The false friends are embarrassed, carpet and library; hospital, animal and chocolate are true friends. The options are in English and are not translated.",
 "¿Cuáles son falsos amigos? Marca todos": "Which are false friends? Tick all that apply",
