 "was doing": "was doing",
 "Juego para moverse por la clase: cinco minutos para encontrar a alguien de cada casilla. Combina los dos tiempos: Have you ever…? / When did you…? Las frases y palabras en inglés van en cursiva o en su propia etiqueta: no se traducen.": "A game for moving around the classroom: five minutes to find someone for each square. It combines both tenses: Have you ever…? / When did you…? English phrases and words are in italics or on their own label: they are not translated.",
