 "Pregunta <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Have you ever…?</i> y, si alguien dice que sí, pide un detalle en past simple: <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">When did you…?</i>": "Ask <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Have you ever…?</i> and, if someone says yes, ask for a detail in the past simple: <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">When did you…?</i>",
